
---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Housekeeping | Silken Valley Lifestyle"
  heroTitle="Good Housekeeping"
  heroText="Practical ideas for an organized, comfortable, and welcoming home."
  heroCompact={true}
>
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Home & Organization</p>
    <h1>Good Housekeeping & Home Management</h1>
    <p>
      A well-maintained home is built through thoughtful routines,
      practical organization, and attention to everyday details.
      Explore helpful cleaning methods, laundry advice, household
      planning, and ideas for creating a beautiful and comfortable
      living environment.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="grid">
    <a class="card" href="/housekeeping/cleaning/">
      <h3>Cleaning & Maintenance</h3>
      <p>Cleaning routines, household care, and maintenance tips.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="/housekeeping/organization/">
      <h3>Home Organization</h3>
      <p>Decluttering, storage, and creating organized spaces.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="/housekeeping/laundry/">
      <h3>Laundry & Fabrics</h3>
      <p>Fabric care, laundry techniques, and household essentials.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="/housekeeping/home-management/">
      <h3>Home Management</h3>
      <p>Household schedules, planning, and everyday systems.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#kitchen-care">
      <h3>Kitchen Care</h3>
      <p>Keeping kitchen surfaces, appliances, and cupboards clean and organized.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#bathroom-care">
      <h3>Bathroom Care</h3>
      <p>Practical bathroom cleaning, sanitation, and maintenance routines.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#bedroom-care">
      <h3>Bedroom & Linen Care</h3>
      <p>Creating restful bedrooms and caring for bedding and household linens.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#seasonal-housekeeping">
      <h3>Seasonal Housekeeping</h3>
      <p>Seasonal cleaning, household preparation, and yearly checklists.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#household-products">
      <h3>Household Products & Supplies</h3>
      <p>Useful cleaning tools, household essentials, and product information.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#sustainable-housekeeping">
      <h3>Responsible Housekeeping</h3>
      <p>Reducing waste, conserving resources, and making thoughtful household choices.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#home-safety">
      <h3>Home Safety</h3>
      <p>Safe cleaning practices, household storage, and everyday precautions.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#household-routines">
      <h3>Daily & Weekly Routines</h3>
      <p>Simple schedules to make household responsibilities more manageable.</p>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section id="kitchen-care" class="content-section">
    <h2>Kitchen Care</h2>
    <p>
      The kitchen is one of the busiest areas of the home and benefits
      from regular attention. Explore practical ways to clean work
      surfaces, maintain appliances, organize cupboards, care for
      sinks, and keep food preparation areas tidy.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="bathroom-care" class="content-section">
    <h2>Bathroom Care</h2>
    <p>
      A clean and well-maintained bathroom contributes to a comfortable
      home. Discover useful routines for cleaning fixtures, maintaining
      tiles and grout, caring for mirrors, organizing toiletries, and
      keeping frequently used surfaces fresh.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="bedroom-care" class="content-section">
    <h2>Bedroom & Linen Care</h2>
    <p>
      Comfortable bedrooms benefit from regular cleaning and thoughtful
      organization. Learn about bedding care, mattress maintenance,
      closet organization, dusting, and keeping household linens in
      good condition.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="seasonal-housekeeping" class="content-section">
    <h2>Seasonal Housekeeping</h2>
    <p>
      Household needs change throughout the year. Explore spring
      cleaning, summer preparation, autumn organization, and winter
      household care. Seasonal checklists can help divide larger
      responsibilities into manageable tasks.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="household-products" class="content-section">
    <h2>Household Products & Supplies</h2>
    <p>
      Choosing appropriate household tools and supplies can make
      everyday tasks easier. Explore cleaning cloths, brushes,
      storage containers, vacuum cleaners, and other useful
      household equipment. Always follow product labels and
      manufacturer instructions.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="sustainable-housekeeping" class="content-section">
    <h2>Responsible Housekeeping</h2>
    <p>
      Thoughtful household habits can help reduce unnecessary waste
      and resource consumption. Consider reusable cleaning materials,
      responsible product choices, water conservation, and practical
      ways to make household routines more sustainable.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="home-safety" class="content-section">
    <h2>Home Safety</h2>
    <p>
      Safe housekeeping includes proper product storage, careful use
      of cleaning equipment, and awareness of household hazards.
      Keep cleaning products in their original containers, follow
      label directions, and never mix cleaning chemicals.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="household-routines" class="content-section">
    <h2>Daily & Weekly Household Routines</h2>
    <p>
      A manageable housekeeping schedule helps prevent everyday
      tasks from becoming overwhelming. Establish simple daily
      habits, divide larger jobs across the week, and set aside
      time for occasional deeper cleaning and seasonal maintenance.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <h2>Explore More Home Resources</h2>
    <p>
      Continue exploring household information, decorating ideas,
      and practical advice throughout Silken Valley Lifestyle.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="/resources/home-guides/">Home Guides</a> |
      <a href="/home-decor/">Home Decor</a> |
      <a href="/resources/">All Resources</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
